      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24002/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place cracker crumbs and eggs into 2 separate shallow bowls. Mix cracker crumbs with garlic salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sDL4pJw2tbTh92-IMYEJHUV2yCo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24002-famous-butter-chicken-VAT-step-02-9f64c190bc6f43d3bae9368d09e8b253.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24002/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip chicken in eggs, then dredge in crumb mixture to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NQ6iEIr24CueQjkDq2CbwYeniFk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24002-famous-butter-chicken-VAT-step-03-dcdaa08f5daf4149bd88b2be6e27e1f2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24002/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange coated chicken in a 9x13-inch baking dish. Scatter butter over and around the chicken.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QqFLRpzRDWGatXK0Fh5yQwCzb6M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24002-famous-butter-chicken-VAT-step-04-2923e8e2ff98494d825bdd1f798feef6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24002/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, about 40 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
